What is Castor Oil?
Castor oil is a pale yellow vegetable oil extracted from castor seeds through pressing or solvent extraction methods. This versatile oil finds extensive use across diverse industries including food preservation, medicinal applications, and industrial lubrication. While the pharmaceutical and cosmetics segments continue to drive substantial revenue, industrial applications are demonstrating particularly strong momentum as manufacturing sectors increasingly prioritize bio-based materials.
